/*
 * Implements validation of variable references in expressions.
 *
 * This module handles:
 *   - resolution of local variables, parameters, and proto-variables,
 *   - resolution of global variables, functions, modules, templates, macros,
 *   - handling of overloaded symbols and multi-symbol resolution,
 *   - construction of VarRefValue, GlobalVarRefValue, ModuleRefValue, etc.,
 *   - and error reporting for undefined or invalid variable usages.
 *
 * Variable resolution is context-sensitive: the current referent stack,
 * protection rules, and symbol categories all influence the result.
 *
 * <hr>
 * 
 * @Package: ymirc        
 * @Module: ymirc::semantic::validator::value::variable::validate
 * @File: ymirc/semantic/validator/value/variable/validate.yr
 * @Author(s):
 *   - Emile Cadorel <ecadorel@gmail.com>
 *
 * @Created (YYYY-MM-DD): 2026-03-26
 * @Copyright (C) 2021–2026 GNU-Ymir
 * @License
 *   ```text
